At build time, the pinned shader and render-engine classes are
retrieved. The local welcome layout derives from HyperCeiler's layout. The
upstream Java package names are retained; the GlowPainter R import is adapted
to RainKernel's namespace. The build fetches the upstream LICENSE text.
